00:08:16,660 --> 00:08:18,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>without lying to me.</b></font>

159
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:21,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wait, we haven't heard
the verdict yet.</b></font>

160
00:08:22,840 --> 00:08:24,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gavel banging]</b></font>

161
00:08:27,760 --> 00:08:29,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Guilty.</b></font>

162
00:08:29,090 --> 00:08:30,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Confiscation.</b></font>

163
00:08:33,680 --> 00:08:35,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] We're back
where we started?</b></font>

164
00:08:35,810 --> 00:08:37,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Now I've been declared guilty.</b></font>

165
00:08:37,640 --> 00:08:39,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't feel any different.</b></font>

166
00:08:39,310 --> 00:08:40,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[gavel whirring]
-[gasps]</b></font>

167
00:08:40,520 --> 00:08:41,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ rock music playing]</b></font>

168
00:08:48,860 --> 00:08:50,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>His gavel!</b></font>

169
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:55,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What a weapon.</b></font>

170
00:08:55,620 --> 00:08:58,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not only can he make it appear
and disappear at will,</b></font>

171
00:08:58,500 --> 00:09:00,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>he can alter its size too?</b></font>

172
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:02,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wait, something's wrong.</b></font>

173
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:05,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You're pretty tough.</b></font>

174
00:09:06,090 --> 00:09:08,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>At least I still have that.</b></font>

175
00:09:11,260 --> 00:09:13,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because I can't control
my cursed energy!</b></font>

176
00:09:20,890 --> 00:09:22,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gavel banging]</b></font>

177
00:09:22,190 --> 00:09:24,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR]
Law apprenticeship period 59.</b></font>

178
00:09:24,810 --> 00:09:28,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Iwate Bar Association's
Hiromi Higuruma.</b></font>

179
00:09:28,070 --> 00:09:29,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Age 36.</b></font>

180
00:09:30,860 --> 00:09:32,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He easily cleared all obstacles,</b></font>

181
00:09:32,860 --> 00:09:34,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>like the entry exam</b></font>

182
00:09:34,120 --> 00:09:36,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to Tokyo University's
School of Law,</b></font>

183
00:09:36,490 --> 00:09:37,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and the old bar exam</b></font>

184
00:09:37,990 --> 00:09:40,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that preceded the institution
of the law school system.</b></font>

185
00:09:41,210 --> 00:09:42,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>To Higuruma,</b></font>

186
00:09:42,290 --> 00:09:43,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it was all a matter of simply</b></font>

187
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:46,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>inputting and outputting
the necessary knowledge</b></font>

188
00:09:46,590 --> 00:09:48,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that was needed
for each individual task</b></font>

189
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:49,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in front of him.</b></font>

190
00:09:50,590 --> 00:09:53,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR] His peers whispered
in the hallways behind his back</b></font>

191
00:09:53,840 --> 00:09:56,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that he was a genius
of some kind.</b></font>

192
00:09:56,180 --> 00:09:57,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And yet,</b></font>

193
00:09:57,680 --> 00:10:00,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the gem that shone brightest
from his unlimited potential</b></font>

194
00:10:00,430 --> 00:10:03,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>was his overwhelming talent
as a jujutsu sorcerer.</b></font>

195
00:10:04,020 --> 00:10:06,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuji grunting]</b></font>

196
00:10:06,190 --> 00:10:08,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>His technique came
with his domain by default.</b></font>

197
00:10:08,980 --> 00:10:10,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But through analyzing
his domain,</b></font>

198
00:10:10,860 --> 00:10:13,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>he also learned the fundamentals
of how barriers work.</b></font>

199
00:10:13,990 --> 00:10:15,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[crashes]
-[Yuji grunts]</b></font>

200
00:10:16,530 --> 00:10:18,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR] Then, working
backwards from barriers,</b></font>

201
00:10:18,990 --> 00:10:21,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>he intuitively gathered how
to manipulate cursed energy</b></font>

202
00:10:21,960 --> 00:10:23,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for physical enhancement.</b></font>

203
00:10:23,460 --> 00:10:26,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And within 12 days
of awakening as a sorcerer,</b></font>

204
00:10:26,290 --> 00:10:29,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>his powers had grown
to match those of a Grade One.</b></font>

205
00:10:29,960 --> 00:10:31,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Before entering the colony,</b></font>

206
00:10:31,550 --> 00:10:34,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Higuruma exorcised
many cursed spirits.</b></font>

207
00:10:34,550 --> 00:10:36,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And he struck down
over 20 players</b></font>

208
00:10:36,600 --> 00:10:39,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who had the misfortune
of attacking him first.</b></font>

209
00:10:48,400 --> 00:10:50,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

210
00:11:17,220 --> 00:11:19,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You lost the ability
to control cursed energy?</b></font>

211
00:11:20,560 --> 00:11:22,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Didn't you
take it from me?</b></font>

212
00:11:23,770 --> 00:11:25,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA]
The penalty of Confiscation</b></font>

213
00:11:25,600 --> 00:11:29,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>makes it temporarily impossible
to use one's curse technique.</b></font>

214
00:11:29,810 --> 00:11:32,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So I'm guessing you've
never had a cursed technique</b></font>

215
00:11:32,110 --> 00:11:33,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to begin with?</b></font>

216
00:11:34,070 --> 00:11:35,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That must be why the penalty</b></font>

217
00:11:35,780 --> 00:11:38,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>switched to blocking
the use of cursed energy.</b></font>

218
00:11:39,160 --> 00:11:41,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Coincidentally,
Confiscation is generally</b></font>

219
00:11:41,780 --> 00:11:44,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>a supplementary sentence
never imposed on its own.</b></font>

220
00:11:45,290 --> 00:11:48,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's terrifying to think
about how good he is.</b></font>

221
00:11:49,290 --> 00:11:51,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How can he hold
his own against me</b></font>

222
00:11:51,340 --> 00:11:52,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>without cursed energy?</b></font>

223
00:11:53,380 --> 00:11:55,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's using his natural
physical prowess,</b></font>

224
00:11:55,920 --> 00:11:57,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>not his might as a sorcerer.</b></font>

225
00:11:57,930 --> 00:12:00,890
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He must have incredibly high
physical durability.</b></font>

226
00:12:00,930 --> 00:12:03,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>When sorcerers lose the use
of their technique,</b></font>

227
00:12:03,850 --> 00:12:06,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>they often struggle with basic
cursed energy control.</b></font>

228
00:12:07,730 --> 00:12:11,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Their instincts probably dull
over the many long years.</b></font>

229
00:12:11,110 --> 00:12:13,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But the complete inability
to use cursed energy</b></font>

230
00:12:13,530 --> 00:12:15,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is even more disadvantageous.</b></font>

231
00:12:15,400 --> 00:12:18,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yet he can still fight this well
under these circumstances.</b></font>

232
00:12:18,610 --> 00:12:20,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My first strike would have
usually settled the battle</b></font>

233
00:12:20,990 --> 00:12:22,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>against most foes.</b></font>

234
00:12:23,330 --> 00:12:25,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If I'm not careful,
he'll trip me up.</b></font>

235
00:12:26,750 --> 00:12:29,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'll crush him
with my full might.</b></font>

236
00:12:34,800 --> 00:12:35,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

237
00:12:35,920 --> 00:12:37,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[creaking]</b></font>

238
00:12:39,590 --> 00:12:40,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

239
00:12:52,400 --> 00:12:53,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

240
00:12:59,320 --> 00:13:00,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

241
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:07,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

242
00:13:07,080 --> 00:13:09,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunting]</b></font>

243
00:13:09,660 --> 00:13:11,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA] You're incredible!</b></font>

244
00:13:11,210 --> 00:13:14,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's like I'm fighting some kind
of unbreakable doll.</b></font>

245
00:13:14,250 --> 00:13:16,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Shit, shit, shit, shit!</b></font>

246
00:13:16,760 --> 00:13:18,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How long will this last?</b></font>

247
00:13:18,210 --> 00:13:19,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I need my cursed energy.</b></font>

248
00:13:19,880 --> 00:13:21,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Come back to me!</b></font>

249
00:13:21,470 --> 00:13:23,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He's got such a strong ability.</b></font>

250
00:13:23,340 --> 00:13:25,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There must be
something I could do.</b></font>

251
00:13:25,390 --> 00:13:28,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Something that puts Higuruma
at a disadvantage.</b></font>

252
00:13:28,520 --> 00:13:29,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Think.</b></font>

253
00:13:29,600 --> 00:13:31,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Think, think!</b></font>

254
00:13:31,810 --> 00:13:33,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A technique for court trials.</b></font>

255
00:13:34,190 --> 00:13:35,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Trials.</b></font>

256
00:13:42,200 --> 00:13:44,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps] Higuruma!</b></font>

257
00:13:44,620 --> 00:13:46,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I want a retrial!</b></font>

258
00:13:46,620 --> 00:13:49,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting]</b></font>

259
00:13:56,420 --> 00:13:57,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You figured it out.</b></font>

260
00:13:57,920 --> 00:13:59,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[panting] That...</b></font>

261
00:13:59,760 --> 00:14:01,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That was... That was close.</b></font>

262
00:14:01,800 --> 00:14:04,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I... I get
a second trial, right?</b></font>

263
00:14:05,220 --> 00:14:07,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR] As long as
the targeted defendant</b></font>

264
00:14:07,050 --> 00:14:09,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>never actually
admitted their guilt,</b></font>

265
00:14:09,180 --> 00:14:11,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>even after having previously
been found guilty</b></font>

266
00:14:11,600 --> 00:14:13,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and subjected
to penalty by Judgeman,</b></font>

267
00:14:14,020 --> 00:14:17,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>they are entitled
to demand up to two retrials.</b></font>

268
00:14:17,650 --> 00:14:21,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Judgeman is incapable
of refusing such a request.</b></font>

269
00:14:23,820 --> 00:14:25,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I demand a do-over!</b></font>

270
00:14:28,830 --> 00:14:31,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The court calls Yuji Itadori.</b></font>

271
00:14:31,160 --> 00:14:34,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You stand accused
of mass murder in Shibuya</b></font>

272
00:14:34,250 --> 00:14:38,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>on the night of Halloween,
October 31st, 2018.</b></font>

273
00:14:41,840 --> 00:14:42,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah.</b></font>

274
00:14:42,840 --> 00:14:44,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I killed all of them.</b></font>

275
00:14:44,550 --> 00:14:45,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm not going to deny it.</b></font>

276
00:14:49,100 --> 00:14:50,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Guilty!</b></font>

277
00:14:50,720 --> 00:14:52,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Confiscation!</b></font>

278
00:14:52,680 --> 00:14:55,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Death penalty!</b></font>

279
00:14:59,400 --> 00:15:01,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YOSHIZAWA] Higuruma.</b></font>

280
00:15:01,530 --> 00:15:03,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ gentle music playing]</b></font>

281
00:15:06,660 --> 00:15:07,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA] Yoshizawa.</b></font>

282
00:15:08,830 --> 00:15:10,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've already submitted
the proposal,</b></font>

283
00:15:10,540 --> 00:15:12,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>if that's what
you're here about.</b></font>

284
00:15:13,410 --> 00:15:15,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No, I'm not here about that.</b></font>

285
00:15:15,710 --> 00:15:17,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I took a look at the documents.</b></font>

286
00:15:17,460 --> 00:15:18,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're wonderful.</b></font>

287
00:15:19,090 --> 00:15:22,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Good enough as-is for the judge
to use in his sentencing.</b></font>

288
00:15:23,920 --> 00:15:26,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You wanted to be either
a public prosecutor</b></font>

289
00:15:26,470 --> 00:15:28,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>or defense lawyer,
is that right?</b></font>

290
00:15:29,220 --> 00:15:30,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yes.</b></font>

291
00:15:30,810 --> 00:15:32,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Consider something else.</b></font>

292
00:15:33,310 --> 00:15:36,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How would you feel
about becoming a judge instead?</b></font>

293
00:15:45,360 --> 00:15:46,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR] The heaviest sentence</b></font>

294
00:15:46,700 --> 00:15:49,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Judgeman can impose
on the guilty</b></font>

295
00:15:49,490 --> 00:15:53,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is Confiscation accompanied
by the death penalty.</b></font>

296
00:15:55,830 --> 00:15:57,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Confiscation
makes it impossible</b></font>

297
00:15:57,620 --> 00:15:59,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for the guilty party
to use their technique,</b></font>

298
00:15:59,830 --> 00:16:03,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>or in Itadori's case,
control his cursed energy.</b></font>

299
00:16:03,050 --> 00:16:04,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>As prosecutor,</b></font>

300
00:16:04,340 --> 00:16:07,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Higuruma is granted
the Executioner's Sword.</b></font>

301
00:16:08,380 --> 00:16:11,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Anyone cut
by the Executioner's Sword</b></font>

302
00:16:11,720 --> 00:16:13,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>will without exception,</b></font>

303
00:16:13,640 --> 00:16:16,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>meet their untimely death.</b></font>

304
00:16:16,640 --> 00:16:20,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA] Being empathetic
to another person's feelings</b></font>

305
00:16:20,060 --> 00:16:22,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>means understanding
their weakness.</b></font>

306
00:16:23,360 --> 00:16:25,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The weakness of victims.</b></font>

307
00:16:25,490 --> 00:16:27,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The weakness of criminals.</b></font>

308
00:16:28,360 --> 00:16:30,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Day after day after day.</b></font>

309
00:16:31,950 --> 00:16:34,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I was so fed up with everything.</b></font>

310
00:16:34,910 --> 00:16:36,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>"So ugly."</b></font>

311
00:16:36,750 --> 00:16:38,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's what I started to think</b></font>

312
00:16:38,330 --> 00:16:41,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>every time I tried to help
someone who needed a break.</b></font>

313
00:16:42,040 --> 00:16:44,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Just like you, Itadori!</b></font>

314
00:16:46,670 --> 00:16:49,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All people are weak and ugly!</b></font>

315
00:16:49,930 --> 00:16:53,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No matter how much you long
for them to have noble souls!</b></font>

316
00:16:55,890 --> 00:16:58,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's nothing for you
down that path!</b></font>

317
00:16:58,230 --> 00:17:00,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The darkness before you
is just that!</b></font>

318
00:17:01,980 --> 00:17:03,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Even if you shine a light on it,</b></font>

319
00:17:04,360 --> 00:17:06,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you'll just find
blinding nothingness!</b></font>

320
00:17:06,900 --> 00:17:07,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuji grunts]</b></font>

321
00:17:13,490 --> 00:17:14,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm sorry.</b></font>

322
00:17:15,120 --> 00:17:17,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I don't want to become a judge.</b></font>

323
00:17:18,910 --> 00:17:20,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts, inhales]</b></font>

324
00:17:22,330 --> 00:17:23,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YOSHIZAWA] I see.</b></font>

325
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:26,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>May I ask why you feel this way?</b></font>

326
00:17:26,960 --> 00:17:30,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA]
All people are weak and ugly.</b></font>

327
00:17:32,430 --> 00:17:34,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm not interested
in promotions,</b></font>

328
00:17:34,760 --> 00:17:36,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>so I'm not cut out for it.</b></font>

329
00:17:37,430 --> 00:17:38,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>However,</b></font>

330
00:17:38,930 --> 00:17:40,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>at the time,</b></font>

331
00:17:40,140 --> 00:17:41,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>at least up until that moment,</b></font>

332
00:17:42,730 --> 00:17:45,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I believed
that the very depravity</b></font>

333
00:17:45,060 --> 00:17:47,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>which no other creatures
possessed</b></font>

334
00:17:47,070 --> 00:17:48,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>was meant to be cherished!</b></font>

335
00:17:49,320 --> 00:17:50,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why?</b></font>

336
00:17:50,990 --> 00:17:52,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yuji Itadori!</b></font>

337
00:17:52,990 --> 00:17:55,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why did you admit your guilt?</b></font>

338
00:17:55,120 --> 00:17:57,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[NARRATOR] The evidence
that Judgeman submits</b></font>

339
00:17:57,330 --> 00:17:59,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>is shared with the sorcerer
before it is revealed</b></font>

340
00:17:59,910 --> 00:18:02,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to the defendant during
the course of the trial.</b></font>

341
00:18:03,250 --> 00:18:05,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA] The evidence
Judgeman provided</b></font>

342
00:18:05,380 --> 00:18:07,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>was about the demon
harbored inside you.</b></font>

343
00:18:07,670 --> 00:18:08,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sukuna!</b></font>

344
00:18:08,920 --> 00:18:10,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You didn't kill them!</b></font>

345
00:18:11,800 --> 00:18:14,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So why? Why?</b></font>

346
00:18:14,090 --> 00:18:15,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

347
00:18:15,340 --> 00:18:16,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[grunts]</b></font>

348
00:18:16,430 --> 00:18:17,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[strains]</b></font>

349
00:18:20,850 --> 00:18:22,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[gasps]</b></font>

350
00:18:22,100 --> 00:18:23,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[groans]</b></font>

351
00:18:28,190 --> 00:18:29,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuji grunts]</b></font>

352
00:18:29,320 --> 00:18:30,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Higuruma groaning]</b></font>

353
00:18:33,400 --> 00:18:34,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Uh, hey.</b></font>

354
00:18:36,200 --> 00:18:39,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Penal Code,
Article 39, Clause One.</b></font>

355
00:18:39,910 --> 00:18:42,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Being deprived
of either sound judgment</b></font>

356
00:18:42,620 --> 00:18:44,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>or control of one's actions</b></font>

357
00:18:44,750 --> 00:18:47,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>qualifies as non compos mentis.</b></font>

358
00:18:49,210 --> 00:18:50,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That night in Shibuya,</b></font>

359
00:18:50,840 --> 00:18:53,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sukuna took control
of your body, didn't he?</b></font>

360
00:18:53,470 --> 00:18:55,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>How do you know about Sukuna?</b></font>

361
00:18:56,090 --> 00:18:57,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>In other words,</b></font>

362
00:18:57,760 --> 00:19:00,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you lacked control
of your actions.</b></font>

363
00:19:00,260 --> 00:19:03,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You didn't voluntarily
surrender control either.</b></font>

364
00:19:03,480 --> 00:19:04,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And so,</b></font>

365
00:19:05,140 --> 00:19:06,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you're innocent.</b></font>

366
00:19:08,610 --> 00:19:10,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You've committed no crime.</b></font>

367
00:19:12,360 --> 00:19:15,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Regardless of all that,
it's still my fault.</b></font>

368
00:19:15,860 --> 00:19:18,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because I was too weak
to stop him.</b></font>

369
00:19:22,080 --> 00:19:23,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I see.</b></font>

370
00:19:24,200 --> 00:19:25,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Higuruma,</b></font>

371
00:19:25,830 --> 00:19:27,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>why did you release
your technique just now?</b></font>

372
00:19:31,840 --> 00:19:33,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wanted to return to my roots.</b></font>

373
00:19:35,590 --> 00:19:36,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Itadori,</b></font>

374
00:19:37,380 --> 00:19:39,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>there may still be
plenty of people</b></font>

375
00:19:39,220 --> 00:19:41,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who are weak and ugly like you,</b></font>

376
00:19:41,220 --> 00:19:42,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>wandering around out there.</b></font>

377
00:19:44,560 --> 00:19:47,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Put your shirt back on
and have a seat.</b></font>

378
00:19:47,310 --> 00:19:49,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm giving you
my hundred points.</b></font>

379
00:20:02,700 --> 00:20:03,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Itadori?</b></font>

380
00:20:03,950 --> 00:20:05,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Hmm?</b></font>

381
00:20:05,250 --> 00:20:07,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Have you ever killed someone
by your own will,</b></font>

382
00:20:07,080 --> 00:20:08,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and not as Sukuna?</b></font>

383
00:20:10,790 --> 00:20:11,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Yuji sighs]</b></font>

384
00:20:16,130 --> 00:20:17,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have.</b></font>

385
00:20:23,260 --> 00:20:24,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I see.</b></font>

386
00:20:26,100 --> 00:20:28,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Didn't it feel awful?</b></font>

387
00:20:29,230 --> 00:20:31,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b></font>

388
00:21:59,820 --> 00:22:02,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA] Kogane,
add a new rule.</b></font>

389
00:22:03,160 --> 00:22:06,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Make possible the transfer
of points between players.</b></font>

390
00:22:07,790 --> 00:22:10,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Of course, this should count
toward the "change in points"</b></font>

391
00:22:10,700 --> 00:22:12,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>mentioned in Rule Number Eight.</b></font>

392
00:22:12,750 --> 00:22:14,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Approved. Rule added.</b></font>

393
00:22:14,750 --> 00:22:16,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Rule Number Ten.</b></font>

394
00:22:16,090 --> 00:22:18,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Players are able
to transfer a number of points</b></font>

395
00:22:18,380 --> 00:22:21,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>of their choosing
to other players in the game.</b></font>

396
00:22:21,090 --> 00:22:22,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sighs in relief]</b></font>

397
00:22:22,510 --> 00:22:25,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA] Kogane, give
one of my points to Itadori.</b></font>

398
00:22:26,100 --> 00:22:27,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KOGANE] As you wish.</b></font>

399
00:22:28,100 --> 00:22:29,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh?</b></font>

400
00:22:29,600 --> 00:22:33,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You have been granted
one point by Hiromi Higuruma.</b></font>

401
00:22:33,810 --> 00:22:35,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA] Now neither of us
will have to worry</b></font>

402
00:22:35,600 --> 00:22:38,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>about our techniques
being stripped for 19 days.</b></font>

403
00:22:39,440 --> 00:22:40,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Take care.</b></font>

404
00:22:41,110 --> 00:22:42,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[YUJI] Higuruma!</b></font>

405
00:22:42,570 --> 00:22:44,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What are you planning to do now?</b></font>

406
00:22:44,700 --> 00:22:46,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You could join us if you want.</b></font>

407
00:22:46,280 --> 00:22:47,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We'd be stronger with your help.</b></font>

408
00:22:49,540 --> 00:22:51,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIGURUMA]
My two remaining points</b></font>

409
00:22:51,540 --> 00:22:54,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>are from the judge
and prosecutor</b></font>

410
00:22:54,040 --> 00:22:56,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that I killed
before coming to Tokyo.</b></font>

411
00:22:56,830 --> 00:22:58,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Once the barriers open up,</b></font>

412
00:22:59,050 --> 00:23:00,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I think I might turn myself in.</b></font>

413
00:23:01,260 --> 00:23:04,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Until then, I'll think about
what I should do next.</b></font>

414
00:23:05,220 --> 00:23:07,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Besides, if I stay with you,</b></font>

415
00:23:07,850 --> 00:23:10,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm likely
to hate myself even more.</b></font>

416
00:23:11,310 --> 00:23:12,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sorry.</b></font>

417
00:23:12,470 --> 00:23:13,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm not criticizing you.</b></font>

418
00:23:15,730 --> 00:23:16,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>See you later.</b></font>

419
00:23:20,190 --> 00:23:21,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[door closes]</b></font>

420
00:23:25,650 --> 00:23:27,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] A new rule
will be added soon.</b></font>

421
00:23:27,370 --> 00:23:28,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[KOGANE] A number of points
of their choosing</b></font>

422
00:23:28,990 --> 00:23:30,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to other players.</b></font>

423
00:23:30,120 --> 00:23:31,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[REGGIE]
If you don't fight to kill...</b></font>

424
00:23:31,370 --> 00:23:32,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI] You're okay with this?!</b></font>

425
00:23:32,750 --> 00:23:34,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[TAKABA] I don't want you
as my Wi-Fi! [yells]</b></font>

426
00:23:34,040 --> 00:23:35,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MEGUMI]
Hand over all your points.</b></font>

427
00:23:35,750 --> 00:23:36,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Do as I say.</b></font>

